The files in this directory come from MAME (https://github.com/mamedev/mame),
src/devices/cpu/m6502/, where each is marked "license:BSD-3-Clause" and
"copyright-holders:Olivier Galibert". cpu/m6502/m6502.hxx and
cpu/m6502/m6502d.hxx are generated from om6502.lst and dm6502.lst by
m6502make.py, all three vendored here. m6502_reference.h and
m6502_reference.cpp are adapted from MAME's m6502.h and m6502.cpp under the
same licence.

